WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.633
Recent developments in education may be undergoing a significant transformation. This is because the model of 'one-on-one teacher guidance combined with artificial intelligence (AI)' is gradually taking shape.

2
00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:25.265
AlphaSchool, located in Texas, USA, represents this new educational philosophy. Students at this school attend liberal arts classes for only two hours a day, which may sound too brief at first, but the results are astonishing.

3
00:00:25.265 --> 00:00:37.898
These students learn more than twice as fast as regular students in national academic progress tests, and their grades also place them in the top 1% nationally. Some elementary school students even acquire advanced math knowledge in just half a year.

4
00:00:37.898 --> 00:00:50.530
AlphaSchool's secret to success lies in overturning traditional classroom teaching methods. In regular schools, one teacher teaches dozens of students, so explaining too quickly makes it difficult for students to understand, and explaining too slowly causes them to easily lose focus.

5
00:00:50.530 --> 00:01:03.163
In contrast, AlphaSchool's teachers, combined with AI technology, provide individualized education tailored to each student's comprehension level. If a student doesn't understand something, the AI immediately adjusts the teaching method and continues to teach until the student fully comprehends it.

6
00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:15.795
This method does not tolerate "pretending to know" and skips no knowledge, allowing the traditional 8 hours of learning content to be condensed into 2 hours of highly efficient lessons. What's even more surprising is that the saved 6 hours are not used for rest, but are critical time for students to truly create a gap.

7
00:01:15.795 --> 00:01:28.428
They use this time for entrepreneurship, presentations, research projects, or writing theses. For example, a 16-year-old female student used her afternoon hours to develop an AI dating app, which surpassed 40,000 downloads.

8
00:01:28.428 --> 00:01:41.060
Another 11-year-old student was invited to a White House event for three historical research papers. These examples show that AlphaSchool not only helps students learn faster but also fosters their creativity and practical skills.

9
00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:53.692
In the age of AI, human value is no longer solely in obedience and execution, but in creativity, leadership, and the ability to solve real problems. The role of AI is to increase efficiency, and humans set the direction and dreams.

10
00:01:53.692 --> 00:02:06.325
Perhaps what will become obsolete in the future is not the students, but the education system born from the current industrial era. Traditional education seems outdated, and we must embrace the new trend of 'one-on-one teacher guidance and AI assistance' to make learning truly a process that awakens potential and creates value.

